qpy-rsync (0.4.1-0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * 0.4.1: post-0.4.0 maintenance release. Search and pane shortcuts are
    application-wide and focus-independent; Ctrl+[/] replace Alt+S/D for the
    location fields; Ctrl+W focuses the native overview tree; the decisions
    bar gains an Undo button. The journal, progress bar, button menus, profile
    prompts, stale-location handling and filter/tooltip behaviour match Qt;
    settings and widget state are plain INI values with no base64 or qpy
    import, and profiles remain JSON.

 -- Eugene San (eugenesan) <eugenesan@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:30:00 -0700

qpy-rsync (0.4.0-0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * 0.4.0: refreshed README and KDE-theme screenshots; screenshots, icon and
    desktop entry moved to resources/; obsolete Actions labels renamed to
    Decisions; Preserve Decisions stays checked when the sync mode changes;
    overview Files row, size-based Share, collapsed folder rows and
    directory-aware Items counts; the native overview follows filters and
    decisions and preserves its sort and expansion; go-jump overview icon;
    folders absent from one side stay blank there; excluding items keeps the
    cursor on the next visible row after the last excluded item; the root row
    has no exclude checkbox, ignores Space and does not collapse; the Decisions
    column no longer collapses folders; overview folders can be excluded with
    Space or restored and filtered from their context menu; native action
    filters hide unrelated directories and count only visible folders; sync
    output keeps only summaries in the journal; fixed the launcher startup
    error.

 -- Eugene San (eugenesan) <eugenesan@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:40:00 -0700

